# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — finish refresh-patch 重命名补丁导致 conandata.yml patch_file 引用失效 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-16
# Software: orcania 2.3.2（任何带 patches/ 且被 finish refresh-patch --auto 重新生成的库）
# Gate: conan create export_sources（G2 / finish W3）
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: DRAFT-orcania-2.3.2-refresh-patch-rename-conandata-mismatch
title: finish refresh-patch --auto 按生成规则把补丁重命名为 NNNN-<path>.patch 并备份旧名，conandata.yml 的 patch_file 若仍引用手动旧名，conan create export_sources 报 Patch file does not exist 阻塞 G2/W3
trigger_tool: conan / refresh-patch / finish
phase: recipe|export|packaging
error_signature: Patch file does not exist|export_conandata_patches\(self\)|export_sources\(\).*Patch|0001-.*\.patch.*does not exist
severity: 3
category: conan|recipe|patch-lifecycle|packaging
match_keywords: refresh-patch, --auto, 重命名, rename, patch_file, conandata.yml, export_conandata_patches, Patch file does not exist, .patch-backup, 0001-CMakeLists.txt.patch, finish, W3, G2
keywords: refresh-patch, --auto, edit-tracker, 补丁重命名, patch 重命名, conandata.yml,
  patch_file, export_conandata_patches, Patch file does not exist, .patch-backup,
  0001-CMakeLists.txt.patch, finish Step1/10, conan create, G2, W3, 补丁引用失效
approach: align-conandata-patch-file-with-generated-name
root_cause: finish 的 refresh-patch --auto 基于编辑追踪器扫描 work 变更后，按生成时规则
  {NNNN}-{相对路径连字符}.patch 重命名补丁（如 0001-CMakeLists.txt.patch），并把旧命名补丁
  移入 patches/.patch-backup-<ts>/；conandata.yml 的 patch_file 是静态声明，若仍引用
  手动旧名（如 0001-ohos-subunit-optional.patch），export_conandata_patches 按声明路径
  找不到文件，conan create 在 export 阶段失败
affected_scope: 所有带 patches/ 目录、conandata.yml 声明 patch_file、且会被 finish
  refresh-patch --auto 重新生成的库；典型触发链为手动放入补丁→finish→conan-verify G2/W3
  报 Patch file does not exist
verification_cmd: grep patch_file conandata.yml; ls patches/*.patch; conan create <recipe> --build=missing
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: align-conandata-patch-file-with-generated-name
rec_description: 以 refresh-patch 实际生成的文件名为准：finish 后检查 patches/ 真实 *.patch
  名，将 conandata.yml 对应条目 patch_file 改为该真实文件名，删除 patches/.patch-backup-*/
  备份目录（防 JC junk），复跑 conan-verify G2 与 finish W3 确认通过
rec_command: ls patches/ && sed -i 's|patches/<旧名>|patches/<生成名>|' conandata.yml && rm -rf patches/.patch-backup-* && ohc-run.py conan-verify <sw> <ver>
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: skip-refresh-patch-rename
fallback_description: 若必须保留自定义补丁名（如跨版本同补丁复用），可禁用 refresh-patch
  自动重命名（不运行 --auto / 手动管理 patches/ 与 conandata.yml 一致），但需确保补丁内容
  与 conandata.yml 声明同步
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: manual-patch-management
principles: conandata.yml 的 patch_file 必须与实际 patches/ 目录文件一一对应；
  任何自动补丁再生成流程后都要重新核对引用名，不能假设手动命名会保留
caused_by: refresh-patch --auto 的补丁重命名规则 + conandata.yml 静态引用旧名
causes: conan create export 阶段失败，G2/W3 阻塞，误报补丁格式错误
similar_to: E515（refresh-patch/conandata patches 工具链同源，strip 参数问题）、
  E254/E484（refresh-patch 产物与 conan 应用侧不匹配，dry-run 污染）
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-orcania-2.3.2-refresh-patch-rename-conandata-mismatch.md
last_updated: 2026-09-16
source_event: orcania 2.3.2 设备 finish：refresh-patch 把补丁重命名为 0001-CMakeLists.txt.patch，
  conandata.yml 引用旧名致 G2/W3 失败，对齐后通过
authors: pc2-25
source_pr: (本 PR)
source_commit: (待提交后回填)
metrics_success_count: 1
metrics_fail_count: 0
metrics_confidence: 1.0
metrics_last_used: 2026-09-16
